  "CE_005140_0000_CER": "「チェシャ、[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]がいるから[RUBY:BASE ]大丈夫[RUBY:BEGIN ]だいじょうぶ[RUBY:END ]。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]思[RUBY:BEGIN ]おも[RUBY:END ]い[RUBY:BASE ]切[RUBY:BEGIN ]き[RUBY:END ]り[RUBY:BASE ]力[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちから[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]使[RUBY:BEGIN ]つか[RUBY:END ]って！」",
