  "SM_006040_0040_MOR": "「[RUBY:BASE ]我[RUBY:BEGIN ]わ[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]子[RUBY:BEGIN ]こ[RUBY:END ]リュカオンの[RUBY:BASE ]封印[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふういん[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]解[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]くために、\r\nどれだけ[RUBY:BASE ]手間[RUBY:BEGIN ]てま[RUBY:END ]をかけたと[RUBY:BASE ]思[RUBY:BEGIN ]おも[RUBY:END ]っている！」\r\n",
