  "BK_6000_0080_CER": "「[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]……あなたのこと[RUBY:BASE ]信[RUBY:BEGIN ]しん[RUBY:END ]じてたのに！」",
